      "value": "本条只写 Antonacci《Absolute Momentum》之 **亚洲除日本ETF绝对动量新标** 可钉核。月末：若 **AAXJ 过去12月总分收益 > BIL 同期** → 满仓 AAXJ，否则 BIL。不是 THD/GREK/EZA/EPOL/EWK/EWN/EWI/EWP/EWL/EWQ/EWC/EWA/EWU/EEM/ECH/ARGT/EIDO/EWW/EWS/EWD/EWH/NORW/EWO/UAE/TUR/EIRL/EWM/EIS/EPHE/EPU/VNM/KSA/EFNL/EDEN/ENZL/QAT/ASHR AbsMom；不是 EPP/FEZ/EZU/AFK 同主题异标；不是 AAXJ 产品页非动量条；不是禁标的AMJ/RSX/GXG/FCYIX；不是 AbsMom·BOTZ。计入美股/ETF。提出日期 2013-10-01。"
